---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="TakeoutFix | Refund Policy" description="Read the Refund Policy for TakeoutFix. Learn about our verified software issue refund guarantee and request conditions.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 mt-12 font-sans min-h-[80vh]">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-6 font-mono">
        Pricing &amp; Refund Policy
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Refund &amp; Pricing Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">Last updated: September 28, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-12 leading-relaxed">
      
      <section class="bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1.5 h-full bg-indigo-500"></div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white mb-3">100% Free &amp; Open Software</h2>
        <p class="text-base text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
          TakeoutFix is an open, client-side utility that is <strong>100% free to use</strong> for all users. We do not charge fees, require paid subscriptions, or sell software licenses. Because there are no mandatory purchases or paywalls, standard software purchase refunds do not apply.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">1. Voluntary Sponsorships &amp; Donations</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          If you choose to support the project via voluntary sponsorship (such as GitHub Sponsors), these contributions directly fund maintenance, bug fixes, and development of open-source format decoders. Sponsorship donations are voluntary and handled in accordance with GitHub Sponsors terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">2. Technical Assistance &amp; Support Guarantee</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Even though the software is free, we stand by our code. If you encounter an unhandled Takeout format, timestamp anomaly, or edge-case error while processing your library, our engineering team is committed to reviewing your debug logs and patching the client engine promptly.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">3. How to Report Issues</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          To report any parsing issues or request support:
        </p>
        <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm">
          <li>Open a support ticket through our <a href="/support" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 hover:underline font-semibold">Support Center</a> or open an issue on GitHub.</li>
          <li>Describe your operating system, browser, and the format of the problematic media files.</li>
          <li>Our engineering team will review your report and release an update.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">4. Contact Desk</h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          For any questions regarding our policies, please contact us via our <a href="/contact" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 hover:underline font-semibold">Contact Page</a> or by email at <a href="mailto:takeoutfix.support@gmail.com" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 hover:underline font-semibold">takeoutfix.support@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
